# Game_SimpleCounter — Tap Race to High Score (ID 2)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_SimpleCounter.h, Game_SimpleCounter.cpp
# HTML: data/game_counter_setup.html, game_counter_names.html, game_counter_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Counting game: players tap to increment score. Highest score wins.
Optional time limit, warning beeps at 5s.

## CONFIG
- activePucks (1-12), timeLimitSeconds, warnEnd

## STATES
STATE_SETUP → STATE_PREPARE (2.5s) → STATE_RUNNING → STATE_FINISHED

## KEY MECHANICS
- 330ms debounce per click
- White flash on each click, restore to chase effect after 150ms
- Highest scorer(s) get RAINBOW (ties handled)
- 10s winner animation then lights reset

## COMMANDS
setup, reset, config_players, config_time, config_warn, start, stop, exit

## STATUS JSON
{state, elapsed, players: [{id, score}]}
